          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಇಂಧನ — indhana — \"fuel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಮಾನಕ್ಕೆ ತುಂಬಾ ಇಂಧನ ಬೇಕು. vimānakke tumbā indhana bēku. An aeroplane needs a lot of fuel."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Petrol, diesel, gas and firewood are all ಇಂಧನ (indhana)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಇಂಧನ (indhana) is borrowed from Sanskrit indhana, \"lighting, kindling, fuel\" (CDIAL 1584), from indh, \"to kindle\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
